Kept: of each building whose city code is 13101 (Chiyoda), its id in the
model (gml:id), its name where the model gives one, its measured height
(bldg:measuredHeight, rounded to 0.1 m) and its roof outline (LOD0,
bldg:lod0RoofEdge) as longitude and latitude in JGD2011, made valid and
rounded to 1e-7 degrees; a height band (under 10 m, 10 to 30 m, 30 to
60 m, 60 to 100 m, 100 m and over) is added. Nothing else of the model is
kept: not the 3D solids, the textures, the addresses or the flood risk
attributes. This is a modified version of the data.


